<title>SWEDEN: Swedish fin min says EMU unlikely without Germany.</title>
<headline>Swedish fin min says EMU unlikely without Germany.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday it was difficult to see Europe's monetary union starting without Germany's participation.</p>
</text>
